     "explanation": "Watching the documentary makes shark attacks **easily available** in memory, which the brain mistranslates as 'common.' The actual annual base rate (~5 US deaths) is dwarfed by road-trip risk (over 35,000 US deaths/year). The substitution feels *safer* because shark attacks are *more memorable*, not because they are more probable. This is the textbook **availability heuristic** at work.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Risk substitution by salience</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"200\" width=\"440\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">SHARK RISK</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">~5 US deaths/yr</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"355\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Highly available</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Vividness ≠ likelihood</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"200\" width=\"440\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">ROAD RISK</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">~35,000 US deaths/yr</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"355\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Low availability</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Routine ≠ safe</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"490\" width=\"740\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"550\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">SWAP IS BACKWARDS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"605\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Avoiding 5 deaths/yr by accepting</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"645\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">a slice of 35,000 deaths/yr</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Availability-led risk choices flip the math"
     }
